    "title": "Find the Centroid of a Binary Tree",
    "category": "Trees",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given a binary tree, determine the centroid node. A centroid is a node such that, after removing it, every remaining connected component contains at most half of the total nodes.",
